{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02686","headline":"荅王无功九日 · 崔善爲","name":"荅王无功九日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋来菊花气，深山客重寻。\n露叶疑涵玉，风花似散金。\n摘来还泛酒，独坐即徐斟。\n王弘贪自醉，无复觅杨林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔善爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}